    "Controlled resource-stage clocks prove stage refusal/atomicity and do not replace actual real-clock A08 success.",
    "Candidate02 native/durable successes remain historical evidence and do not establish final candidate03 delivery.",
    "Other complete acceptance roles, optional Agent/store/state supplements and platform gates must use their own exact-pin receipts; this review does not infer them from a unit-test count.",
